00:24:58.460 --> 00:25:01.540
But when I started at Google,
I was helping build out

00:25:01.540 --> 00:25:03.520
CRE offerings with PSO.

00:25:03.520 --> 00:25:06.310
So I think you've had
some of the CRE folks

00:25:06.310 --> 00:25:07.990
on the podcast before.

00:25:07.990 --> 00:25:11.170
So CRE, just for folks who
might not have heard that,

00:25:11.170 --> 00:25:13.120
