Reliability Engineer.

00:25:13.120 --> 00:25:16.810
So they are some of our
site reliability engineers

00:25:16.810 --> 00:25:19.870
who are customer-facing and
work with some of our larger

00:25:19.870 --> 00:25:24.370
customers on building out SRE
practices within their org.

00:25:24.370 --> 00:25:29.380
So the CRE team is small
and just overbooked.

00:25:29.380 --> 00:25:32.300
So they were looking to
see how they can grow this.

00:25:32.300 --> 00:25:34.300
So they've partnered with PSO.

00:25:34.300 --> 00:25:37.180
So we're starting to
offer CRE offerings.

00:25:37.180 --> 00:25:40.060
So some of this is
just going in and doing

00:25:40.060 --> 00:25:42.550
kind of basic SRE 101.

00:25:42.550 --> 00:25:46.330
