SLO-SLI workshops.

00:25:46.330 --> 00:25:48.525
So this is taking a
customer's application,

00:25:48.525 --> 00:25:49.900
and we're running
it through what

00:25:49.900 --> 00:25:53.710
it might look like to set error
budgets and your SLO and SLIs.

00:25:53.710 --> 00:25:57.650
So the little bit I got to work
on that six or so months ago

00:25:57.650 --> 00:25:58.780
was really exciting.

00:25:58.780 --> 00:26:00.340
But it's starting
to kick off now.

00:26:00.340 --> 00:26:03.590
So there's a few folks within
PSO who are driving that.

00:26:03.590 --> 00:26:05.712
So I'm really excited
to see where that goes.

00:26:05.712 --> 00:26:07.420
MICHAEL WALLMAN: Just
to follow up there,

