coming with the whole,

00:26:27.700 --> 00:26:28.970
I want to run like Google.

00:26:28.970 --> 00:26:31.090
So you can lift and
shift a monolith

00:26:31.090 --> 00:26:34.420
and actually apply
SRE principles

00:26:34.420 --> 00:26:35.920
to these monolith applications.

00:26:35.920 --> 00:26:37.430
So we're doing that as well.

00:26:37.430 --> 00:26:40.390
So we're trying to kind of embed
this during the transition.

00:26:40.390 --> 00:26:42.030
